Cell["\<\
We translate your directive into a symbolic comparison between variables in \
the Layer 1 action and a user-specified standard parameter set. \
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"365d617f-1484-5942-983c-99a00e0b06a2"],

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
