Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["13. Recommended next refinement steps", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"264c2527-f195-ff40-aaf1-27a8b2b1ab0b"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Section A: Improve the action", "Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"52dc4024-70f6-bd41-93b5-236e30a5d656"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The current Layer 1 action has no derivative terms, so the Euler equations \
are algebraic rather than PDEs. A more structurally rich next step is: ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{
         StyleBox["L", "TI"], "\[LongEqual]", "\[Rho]", "log", 
         RowBox[{"(", "\[Chi]", ")"}], "+", "\[Chi]", 
         SuperscriptBox[
          StyleBox["R", "TI"], "2"], "+", 
         SubscriptBox[
          StyleBox["a", "TI"], "\[Rho]"], "|", "\[Del]", "\[Rho]", 
         SuperscriptBox["|", "2"], "+", 
         SubscriptBox[
          StyleBox["a", "TI"], "\[Chi]"], "|", "\[Del]", "\[Chi]", 
         SuperscriptBox["|", "2"], "+", 
         SubscriptBox[
          StyleBox["a", "TI"], 
          StyleBox["R", "TI"]], "|", "\[Del]", 
         StyleBox["R", "TI"], 
         SuperscriptBox["|", "2"]}], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, 
     "input" -> 
     "\\mathcal{L} = \\rho \\log(\\chi) + \\chi R^2 + a_\\rho |\\nabla \
\\rho|^2 + a_\\chi |\\nabla \\chi|^2 + a_R |\\nabla R|^2", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "86e64238-dd38-bb42-b505-1a9f7d07f730"],
 "This would produce true field equations and enable a meaningful stability \
spectrum. "
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"5b59f750-be07-bf41-82ba-045b5a9c4556"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Section B: Make toroidal closure geometric", "Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"4a461e91-f4d2-5842-a413-d928c32bdc21"],

Cell["\<\
Replace the closure functional with an explicit toroidal embedding: \
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"0e014e71-d407-1b40-ba65-89789518b19d"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "parameterize a torus in ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       SuperscriptBox[
        StyleBox["R", FontSlant -> "Plain"], "3"], TraditionalForm], 
     "errors" -> {}, "input" -> "\\mathbb{R}^3", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "9fa69816-86ce-144d-9af0-8c2133b47043"],
 ","
}], "Item",ExpressionUUID->"d33a007d-8610-0145-95b7-d3f305e914d4"],

Cell["define a field on the torus,", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"01fa61f1-7d5b-0b49-99a9-628494684c3f"],

Cell["impose periodicity and closure residuals,", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"77a1aca8-8b6e-5c46-bfb6-9d38f64a17a9"],

Cell["compare spherical and toroidal formulations.", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"cc6d8790-5154-6f4f-a4df-9fe479872bee"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Section C: Define \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]smallest stable scale\
\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] operationally", "Subsection",ExpressionUUID->\
"e4e2c4fb-651e-8f45-bfc4-64fe8e6805ce"],

Cell["\<\
At present, stability is only a residual notion. We should formalize it by \
requiring:\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"fde9af29-a0af-e74f-b15e-b23e53b061c7"],

Cell["1. bounded closure residual,", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"d1af0675-6f9f-784f-a79c-bf67ee336e3c"],

Cell["2. positive-definite or semibounded energy,", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"6a49e9cc-0db2-6141-9ca9-98311495a5f0"],

Cell["3. nondivergent measurement functional,", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"297d48d6-50d4-d242-ab74-6d412077d9db"],

Cell["4. linearized spectrum without exponentially growing modes,", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"e7640b96-3ee0-dd49-a82f-5c4f2c57d148"],

Cell["5. reproducibility under precision refinement. ", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"27756843-550a-074d-ac3f-c25b3c79ad63"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Section D: Only then test particle-like claims", "Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"01b710db-62bb-d848-af03-3334ae828cec"],

Cell["\<\
If you want to investigate whether a smallest toroidally closed stable mode \
resembles a quark-like classification, the next stage should compare derived \
invariants against observed quantum numbers rather than assume the \
identification. \
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"2348e5a6-3792-2e41-98f4-e8821927bd4a"],

