 "If desired, the next step is to build ",
 StyleBox["Section 2 only",
  FontWeight->Bold],
 ": a mathematically explicit ",
 StyleBox["toroidal geometry module",
  FontWeight->Bold],
 " for the smallest scale, with symbolic parameterization, closure \
constraints, and tests."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"00d643a9-b7bd-3e4c-9e90-f599bfa81576"],

