   "\nThe next mathematically cleaner extension would be to replace the \
flat-torus proxy operator by a true torus Laplace--Beltrami operator built \
from the induced metric. That would allow:\n\n1. linearization directly on \
the embedded torus geometry,\n2. geometry-dependent eigenspectrum shifts,\n3. \
and comparison between flat-proxy and embedded-torus stability results. \n",
