Reject textbook approximations unless derived herein.\n\n[LAYER_0: \
NOTHINGNESS]\nGeometry: Sphere.\nBoundaryDuality: {Vertices \[RightArrow] {0, \
\[Infinity]}} coexistent.\nTemporalMode: Timeless (\[PartialD]/\[PartialD]t \
\[NotElement] Domain).\nSubstrate: EmptySpacetime.\nPotential: \
InfiniteComputational (Cardinality = \[Aleph]\:2081, un-collapsed).\n\n\
[LAYER_1: QUANTUM_FIELD]\nStateVector: \[CapitalPsi][\[Rho], \[Chi], R], \
where:\n  \[Rho] = InformationDensity (scalar per unit scale),\n  \[Chi] = \
FieldComplexity (algorithmic depth),\n  R = ObservationalResolution (grid \
grain).\nOperation: Self-Measuring information transfer.\nAction: Calculates \
underlying \[Infinity] across all dimensional directions simultaneously.\n\
Constraint: Must yield stable solutions across all scales (ScaleInvariance \
\[RightArrow] True).\nFormalism: Map to Variational Calculus (EulerEquations \
of S = \[Integral][\[Rho] Log[\[Chi]] + \[Chi] R^2] d\[CapitalOmega]).\n\n\
[LAYER_2: PHYSICAL_REALITY]\nDefinition: Decohered, measured subset of \
Layer_1.\nState: Persistently maintained (requires MaintenanceOperator: \
D[#,t] + \[CapitalGamma]# = 0).\nMapping: Observables = NIntegrate[\
\[CapitalPsi], {Coordinates}] over the eigenbasis of Layer_1.\n\n\
[SOLVER_DIRECTIVES (Universal Rules)]\n1. Alignment: Minimize \
entropy-information divergence with formal logic (Validate via \
ResidueAnalysis).\n2. MissingVariables: Compute \
Complement[Variables[Layer_1_Action], StandardModelConstants]. Use Reduce[Eq \
== 0, vars, MaxExtraConditions \[RightArrow] All].\n3. StableFrequencies: \
Linearize Layer_1 operator. Compute Eigenvalues[StiffnessMatrix]. Isolate \
\[Lambda] where Re(\[Lambda]) = 0 \[And] Im(\[Lambda]) > 0 (undamped harmonic \
modes).\n4. MathematicalPerfection: Prioritize closed-form analytic (DSolve) \
over numeric. If numeric, enforce Abs[Residual] < 10^-50 via NestWhile \
refinement on R.\n5. FunctionalCompleteness: Map all Homomorphisms (L0 \
\[RightArrow] L1 \[RightArrow] L2). Expose all derived morphisms as callable \
pipelines.\n6. Efficiency: Minimize computational path length. Chain \
compositions via RightComposition (/*) to reduce memory allocation.\n7. \
HighResolution (HARD RULE): All spatial/temporal integrations require \
WorkingPrecision \[RightArrow] Infinity. Set $MaxPrecision = $MinPrecision = \
